  "_comment": "A deliberately held, not-yet-validated belief (§4.3, 'Declared hypothesis'). The assertion sits at rkaf:searchOnly, honouring the cap that keeps a hypothesis findable but not actionable until an EvidenceBinding-with-fragment replaces the reason. That cap is a PRODUCER OBLIGATION: rkaf:usageEligibility lives on the assertion envelope and rkaf:noEvidenceReason on the binding, so no compiled shape sees both. This fixture demonstrates the obligation; it does not prove enforcement, because there is none."
